        <briefdescription>
<para>Compute Type-II Discrete Cosine Transform (DCT-II) on Q7 data. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Transforms time-domain sensor samples into frequency-domain coefficients. Formula: X_k = Sum_{n=0}^{N-1} x_n * cos(pi/N * (n + 0.5) * k)</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>time_series</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Pointer to input time-domain sample vector (length = num_samples). </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>num_samples</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Number of time-domain input samples. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>dct_coeffs</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Destination vector for frequency coefficients (length = num_coeffs). </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>num_coeffs</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Number of output frequency coefficients to retain (num_coeffs &lt;= num_samples). </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
<simplesect kind="return"><para>SYN_OK on success, SYN_INVALID_PARAM on failure. </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
        </detaileddescription>
